WEBVTT

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.860
Is she having another nightmare?

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:12.740
<i>Now she won't have any scary dreams.</i>

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:24.180
What?!

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:28.460
<i>This is bad! My vision's been taken out.</i>

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:31.880
<i>Was that a demi-human?</i>

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.300
<i>What do I do? My sight isn't coming back.</i>

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.150
Hey, wait! Please!

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:41.880
<i>I guess I have no choice.</i>

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:51.960
Careful, Uzuma. I think he's 
using some kind of spirit art!

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:56.660
Don't worry. It's a spirit art that 
detects the od in the area, that's all.

00:00:56.660 --> 00:01:00.660
But we should probably assume 
that he knows our numbers.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:02.150
Wait, please!

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:04.620
Are you demi-humans?

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.040
If you are, I'd like to talk!

00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:10.270
Sara, humans are a dishonorable lot.

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:14.400
I know. But we need to 
learn what his aims are.

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:17.760
In that case, we should prepare 
for the worst case scenario...

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:20.570
Orphia, Alma, for now, investigate in there.

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:21.530
Understood.

00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:23.660
Will do, Sara.

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:25.180
Uzuma, stand by.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:26.460
Understood.

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:30.710
We shall accept your proposition.

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:32.360
However...

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:37.360
We would rather you not refer to us by 
the derogatory epithet "demi-human."

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:41.770
I thank you for your ready consent.

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:43.370
I am called Rio.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.500
With regard to the term I used,

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:49.380
it was not my intent to cause 
any offense. I apologize.

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:50.830
Sara!

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:52.440
There's a child of the beast people here!

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:55.230
It looks like spirit arts have 
been used to make her sleep!

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:00.720
Uzuma!

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.200
I haven't given any orders yet!

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:07.040
He's a marauder who has kidnapped 
one of our kin. And...

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:10.250
Watch out! He's using 
some kind of spirit art!

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:10.980
What?

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:13.000
It seems like some kind 
of healing spirit art.

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:14.900
Hey!

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:17.610
Wait, please!

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:20.160
What's the meaning of this?

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:26.000
We have ascertained that you 
have one of our kin in there.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.950
As we have questions about this situation,
 we will have you restrained.

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:30.500
This is a misunderstanding!

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:33.710
I was hoping that you would take 
her under your protection!

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:38.770
Who would trust a human's... 
much less a kidnapper's word?

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:41.760
I didn't kidnap her! Listen to—

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:45.010
What's this?

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:50.210
Your actions are needless.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:19.220
Seirei Gensouki

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:19.220
Seirei Gensouki

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:35.370
<b>Forest of Spirits</b>

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:35.370
<b>Forest of Spirits</b>

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:34.620
Haruto?

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:42.500
You... Who are you?

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:45.760
Me? I... wonder who I am...

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:47.290
You don't know?

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:48.260
No.

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:51.770
But you know about me, don't you?

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:53.610
About you, Haruto?

00:04:53.610 --> 00:04:56.320
Haruto is... Haruto.

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:59.270
That's not really an answer.

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:02.200
In that case, why do you know about me?

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:06.380
Because I'm connected to you, Haruto.

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:08.420
Connected to me?

00:05:08.420 --> 00:05:10.260
Yes. It's still too soon...

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:13.750
But I belong only to you.

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:16.570
What do you mean?

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:21.750
I'm sorry. It seems our time is up.

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:22.900
Time?

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:26.760
Yes. This is all I can do.
 It isn't much, but...

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:29.600
At least you'll have sweet dreams.

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:34.570
Haru-kun?

00:05:34.570 --> 00:05:36.080
Haru-kun, wake up!

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:40.860
Mii-chan? Mii-chan!

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:43.670
Mii-chan!

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.260
Mii-chan?

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:47.200
Mii-chan—

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:49.050
Are you all right?

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.000
Onii-chan!

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:57.810
Latifa...

00:05:57.810 --> 00:05:59.330
Why are you crying?

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:02.460
You were gone, Onii-chan!

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:05.380
I don't want that! Don't leave me.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:06.400
Ow!

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:09.280
Could you please hug me a little more gently?

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:12.110
Huh? Are you hurt? Why?

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:13.960
What's this?

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:19.190
Who did this?

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:24.650
Dear, dear. Can you not walk a little slower?

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:27.070
As I thought.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:30.380
Human boy, our apologies.

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:35.720
I would like to hear about that young girl.

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:37.930
Can I ask for your cooperation?

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:41.540
More importantly, were you the ones
 who did this to Onii-chan?

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:42.900
That's right.

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:46.750
Sir Rio!

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:48.710
I offer my sincerest apologies!

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:52.220
Please, allow us to apologize, too!

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:56.640
Sir Rio, truly, you have 
our most sincere apologies!

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:59.630
If the misunderstanding has been resolved, 
that's the most important thing.

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:04.250
Uzuma will take full responsibility 
for her thoughtless actions.

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:06.700
As will these girls.

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:08.240
Yes, I understand.

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:11.340
But for now, everyone, 
please raise your heads.

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:14.670
Orphia, quickly now. Aren't you going 
to release his shackles for him?

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:15.740
Y-Yes!

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:21.070
Sir Rio, tomorrow morning,
 the Elders will gather

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:24.130
to give you a formal apology.

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:28.130
For tonight, I apologize that all we 
can offer is this humble room,

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:31.770
but I hope you and Miss Latifa will 
be able to rest well here.

00:07:31.770 --> 00:07:35.160
Thank you very much. 
We will accept your kind offer.

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:39.580
Good. I have many preparations 
that must be made as well.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:43.770
If you'll allow me, I'll excuse myself.

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:15.590
What is that?

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:21.130
That is the World Tree in which the great 
Dryas, a spirit of mighty trees, resides.

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:22.310
Big, isn't it?

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:23.240
Yes.

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:27.610
Heading for that tree is 
what brought me this far.

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:29.770
Impressive.

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:34.290
A high-level illusion magic barrier
 is erected around that tree.

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:37.290
Without considerable knowledge 
of the spirit arts,

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:39.030
one should not be able 
to see through it, but...

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:41.230
Really?

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:46.990
Sir Rio, you were not apprenticed under 
anyone in the spirit arts, correct?

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:52.450
If what I use is the spirit arts, 
then I'm basically self-educated.

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:54.000
I see.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:57.720
What an outrageous talent you have.

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:00.180
Here we are.

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:05.210
Sir Rio, please sit here.

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:10.130
Well, shall we commence 
this council of the Elders?

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:14.570
As we have asked the human boy 
to be present on this occasion,

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:18.410
we shall proceed using 
the language of humans.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:22.340
I am one of the Eldest, who bring 
together the People of the Spirits

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:25.410
who live in this village. 
I am called Syldora.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:28.990
These two beside me are also of the Eldest.

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:31.670
You already know Ursula.

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:34.220
This dwarf man here is—

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:38.160
I'm Dominic! Nice to meet you, human kid.

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:42.180
As you can see, he has quite 
a forthright personality.

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:45.180
I apologize if he causes any offense.

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:48.080
I thank you for your courtesy.

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.320
I am pleased to meet you.

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:51.450
I am called Rio.

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:54.700
Please, there is no need for 
such deference, Sir Rio!

00:09:55.460 --> 00:10:00.200
Considering our misunderstanding 
caused such great troubles from our kin,

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:05.540
and that you freed one of our kin 
who had been taken into slavery,

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:10.280
we offer you our apologies and 
our most heartfelt thanks.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:14.200
I am honored by your words 
of apology and gratitude.

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:19.310
The fault lies also with me, for so 
thoughtlessly setting foot in your domain.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.520
Please, raise your heads.

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:25.310
Your generous understanding 
makes our hearts ache.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:31.340
We were hoping we might be able to do 
something as a sign of our gratitude, but...

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:34.070
What do you mean?

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.430
As we are of different peoples,

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:42.070
it is difficult for us to determine what 
would show our gratitude to you, Sir Rio.

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:44.070
I see. In that case...

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:47.580
Would you take Latifa into your care?

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:51.180
Sir Rio, that is <i>our</i> wish.

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:55.770
It is something we should be bowing 
our heads and asking of you.

00:10:55.770 --> 00:10:57.590
Though you say that...

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:01.610
Please, tell us what you desire.

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:10.850
If it were possible, right now, she... 
I think she's grown attached to me, so...

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:14.350
Sir Rio, please, you do not 
need to say anything more.

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:19.740
For Latifa's sake, won't you live here 
with her in the village for a while?

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.590
You wouldn't mind?

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:22.650
We would not.

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:25.900
All of the Eldest here are in agreement.

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:28.120
We would like to ask you to stay.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.650
That's right! Quit being so polite!

00:11:30.650 --> 00:11:33.290
You're an even better man than 
Ursula made you out to be.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.850
I like you, kid.

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:38.130
Yes, it's just as Ursula and Dominic say.

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:41.010
We intend to take every measure to make sure

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.770
living in this village 
poses no inconvenience.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:48.990
If you discover anything you want in the
 meantime, please don't hesitate to tell us.

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:51.810
That's right! And it doesn't 
have to be an object.

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:55.420
You can even marry one of 
the girls from our village!

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:58.600
Dominic, don't get so carried away!

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:00.780
Are you drunk already, you scoundrel?

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:04.990
Sir Rio, that's the way things stand.

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:06.850
All right.

00:12:07.230 --> 00:12:10.250
While I live in the village,
 then, the spirit arts...

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:13.570
And any knowledge that seems 
useful for daily life...

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:15.370
If I could be taught such things...

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:16.610
I see.

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:19.400
Something like that should be
 no trouble at all.

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:23.050
Indeed. We'll need to find 
an accomplished teacher.

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:26.220
Well, it seems that conversation 
has come to a close.

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:29.470
Would it be all right to 
move on to my business?

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:42.980
Why... Lady Dryas.

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:50.720
Sir Rio, the personage before you is the 
spirit of the World Tree, Lady Dryas.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:53.080
What? A spirit?

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:57.590
Pleased to meet you, Rio.

00:12:57.590 --> 00:12:59.130
Yes, pleased to meet you.

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:01.540
Hmm, just as I thought.

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:06.310
It's very weak, but I sense the 
presence of a spirit within you.

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:09.080
Is it... sleeping?

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:10.930
A spirit? Inside me?

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:12.930
Yes. Do you have an idea what it might be?

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:15.740
I think you've probably made a covenant with it.

00:13:15.740 --> 00:13:18.490
A covenant? No, I don't have any 
particular memory of that...

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:21.440
I see. That's strange.

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:23.500
If you make a covenant with a spirit,

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:26.620
things like an inability 
to use magic often occur,

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:28.640
which can be difficult for a human.

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:31.450
Oh. In that case, I've definitely...

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:34.500
There is one person who can't use it.

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:37.800
You're a hindrance who can't even use magic,

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:40.130
but we've prepared a job that even you can do.

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:45.090
Say, would it be all right 
if I looked into it a little?

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:47.100
Yes, I'd appreciate that.

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:49.340
Then, please excuse the intrusion.

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:59.310
My! You have an incredible 
amount of od hidden inside you!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:02.550
It looks delicious! Are you really a human?

00:14:03.170 --> 00:14:03.940
What?

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.640
Did you find something?

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:09.890
More than something, it's...

00:14:10.270 --> 00:14:16.160
It's like there's a person-shaped spirit...
sleeping inside you.

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:19.770
A person-shaped spirit?

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:25.590
Hmm, with that reaction, I'd guess you don't 
know how rare a person-shaped spirit is.

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:27.150
N-No, I don't.

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:28.600
To put it simply...

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:31.640
Spirits that can take the 
shape of a person, like me,

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:34.720
are of the second-highest class or greater.

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:40.450
So one of these person-shaped 
spirits sleeps within Sir Rio?

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:41.390
Yes.

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:45.530
The spirits of the highest class, 
once called the Six Great Spirits,

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:52.240
all went missing in the Divine-Demon War
 over a thousand years ago.

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:55.030
The spirit sleeping within Rio...

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:59.210
may be one of those
 high-class spirits, don't you think?

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:04.590
If... If it is a high-class spirit, 
would that cause some kind of problem?

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:06.800
I don't think so, but...

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:10.510
Oh, but for the children of the village, 
it might be a matter of great importance.

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:13.450
I'm only a spirit of the second-highest class,

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:15.760
and they've gone and 
deified me, after all.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:16.930
That's...

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:19.450
What does that mean?

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:20.770
It would mean that

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:26.010
we must once again rethink the manner 
in which we treat you, Sir Rio.

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:26.860
What?

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.510
To put it plainly, Sir Rio,

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:33.750
we would discuss whether it would 
be better to treat you as a saint.

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:35.990
A... saint?

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.400
Don't worry about the details!

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:43.380
Just think of it getting extra-special
 treatment while you're in our village.

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:46.130
I'll do that, then.

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:01.620
Onii-chan!

00:16:07.260 --> 00:16:09.760
Welcome home, Sir Rio.

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:12.400
Onii-chan! This house is amazing!

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:15.050
It has an open-air bath!

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:17.710
A kitchen!

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:20.710
A beautiful view.

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:21.400
Yes.

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:25.920
It's delicious!

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:29.120
Is that...

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:30.410
This?

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:35.340
Oryza grains are threshed to remove 
the hulls, then cooked with saffron.

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.370
Oryza?

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:38.140
Yes.

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:42.310
It's a foodstuff that originated 
in the Yagumo region.

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:44.950
Do you not have it in the Strahl region?

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:46.310
No.

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:49.840
That's right! They have rice here!

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:52.260
Rice! Rice!

00:16:52.260 --> 00:16:53.970
What are you saying? You're so strange.

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:56.280
But, I mean, it's okome!

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:01.310
Um... I was wondering, Sir Rio,

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:05.420
which rooms would you like us to sleep in?

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:06.940
I'm sorry?

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:09.980
Huh? Um... The Eldest...

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:13.030
Lady Ursula didn't mention anything to you?

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:15.180
About what?

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:20.500
The three of us are to live here in this 
house and look after both of you, Sir Rio.

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:21.190
What?

00:17:21.550 --> 00:17:24.380
All of you are going to live here, too?

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:26.230
Yes. Would you rather we didn't?

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:28.690
I-I don't know...

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:30.620
It's just...

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:33.070
Sir Rio, forgive the intrusion.

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:34.380
Mistress Ursula...

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:37.130
Regarding Sara and the others 
living here with you,

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:40.010
I humbly ask your permission.

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:41.510
Though you say that...

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:45.790
Won't it cause problems for them? 
Living with a human like me...

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.980
That's precisely why they should.

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:53.170
Talk of you and Latifa has already 
spread among the villagers.

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:57.520
If the higher-ups in the village approach 
you as they might some kind of abscess,

00:17:57.520 --> 00:17:59.380
that would be far worse.

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:00.640
I see.

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:03.950
This is for Latifa's sake, too.

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:07.240
Someone besides you who can 
be her guardian, her friend...

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:10.650
She needs someone who will 
stay by her side, correct?

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:12.780
That is true, but...

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:15.980
Then we shall consider 
the matter settled.

00:18:15.980 --> 00:18:20.360
Oh, well, I am grateful for 
what it means for Latifa.

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:23.280
As long as we aren't imposing
on Miss Sara and the others.

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:26.470
That's wonderful, isn't it, everyone?

00:18:27.820 --> 00:18:30.180
Thank you so much, Sir Rio!

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:33.390
Not at all. It is I who 
should be thanking you.

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:35.340
I will be counting on you from now on.

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:36.690
Of course, Sir Rio!

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:38.760
Oh... and...

00:18:39.140 --> 00:18:42.540
I would be grateful if you 
would stop using "sir" with me.

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:45.720
Well, in that case...

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:48.330
Would Master Rio be acceptable?

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:51.730
Yes, that will be fine. Please go with that!

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:44.660
We will now begin the rites 
for the Grand Spirit Festival!

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:48.160
Here, under the profound 
grace of the great spirits,

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:50.360
we hope that blessings 
and divine protection

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:55.040
shall forever accompany us, the People 
of the Spirits, on the path we travel.

00:19:57.960 --> 00:19:59.860
Lady Dryas!

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:16.900
Now, then, I believe it's 
about time to descend.

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:20.350
Let's go.

00:20:20.350 --> 00:20:21.360
Y-Yes, sir!

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.970
A-Are we going in there?

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:26.150
Yes.

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:32.580
Around this time, the master of that 
cave will be out looking for food.

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:36.710
It won't be returning for a while,
 so please, don't worry.

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:39.500
You wait here.

00:20:42.190 --> 00:20:47.740
Well done in making it this far in your 
effort to join the Celestial Lion Brigade.

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:49.600
If you clear this next test,

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:54.250
you will receive permission to officially 
join the brigade as a member.

00:20:54.250 --> 00:20:55.100
Sir!

00:20:57.740 --> 00:21:01.290
<i>Oh, good! Now all that's left is to get back.</i>

00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:05.290
M-Master Reiss, what is that?

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:08.730
It's obvious, isn't it? It's an egg.

00:21:08.730 --> 00:21:10.290
Wh-What kind of egg?

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.380
What's this? Would you really like to know?

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:13.540
Oh! Um... No!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:15.960
We are considering what, after griffins,

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:20.920
might be used to newly augment 
the Celestial Lion Brigade's military strength.

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:21.880
What?

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:25.070
You will carry this egg, please.

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:28.610
I must manage the griffin, after all.

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:30.430
Y-Yes, sir.

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:34.010
Well then, let us return.

00:21:34.010 --> 00:21:39.270
The parent won't get angry and come 
to take back the egg... right?

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:45.040
The distance between here and the Strahl 
region is considerable, is it not?

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:48.740
That's true...

